Looking at this problem, I need to prove that $f(a_0, \dots, a_{n-1}) = f(a_{n-1}, \dots, a_0)$ where $f$ is defined via the recurrence $u_0 = u_1 = 1$, $u_{k+2} = u_{k+1} + a_k u_k$.

